%% Phase2 / post / G-06 reaction/quickReply 绝对态
%% Helix owners: event/post/reaction.rs; channel/write/reaction.rs; ws/handlers/post_update.rs; port_reply/message_v3_reaction.rs
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as PC Angular UI
  participant Gate as messageV3ImGate
  participant Native as Tauri/Native
  participant FFI as Mobile FFI
  participant Web as Browser/Web
  participant E as ExecutionShell/Tick
  participant IM as helix-im
  participant Host as driver-host
  participant DB as tenant SQLite
  participant Go as Go IM server
  participant WS as WS inbound
  participant Sink as EventSink/adapter

  alt PC Tauri 入口
    UI->>Gate: quickReply({postId,emoji})
    Gate->>Native: invokeAccepted("im_quick_reply", payload)
    Native->>E: Tick::Command(AppCommand)
  else Mobile FFI 入口
    FFI->>E: helix_command("im_quick_reply", payload)
  else Web 入口
    Web->>E: invoke("im_quick_reply", payload)
  end
  E->>IM: step(Tick::Command)
  IM->>IM: validate post/emoji and correlation
  IM->>Host: Effect::Http POST quick-reply
  Host->>Go: HTTP reaction admission
  Go-->>Host: 2xx admission（不发布 reaction 终态）
  Go-->>WS: WS post_update.quickReply(event_seq)
  WS->>E: Tick::Inbound(post_update)
  E->>IM: parse quickReply map → bounded absolute array
  alt event_seq is next
    IM->>Host: Effect::PersistAtomic(message.quick_reply + cursor)
    Host->>DB: single mutation of message and cursor
    DB-->>Host: PortReply(PersistOk)
    Host->>E: Tick::PortReply
    IM->>Host: Persist ScopedGet message
    Host->>DB: readback same postId quickReply
    DB-->>Host: PortReply(readback)
    Host->>E: Tick::PortReply
    IM->>Sink: Emit im:post:updated(data.quickReply absolute)
    Sink-->>UI: Angular renders reaction array/count from event
    Sink-->>FFI: batch raw updated event
    Sink-->>Web: EventBatch raw updated event
  else gap or duplicate
    IM->>IM: buffer gap or drop duplicate；do not Emit
  end
  Note over UI,Web: current viewer selected state derives from userIds；shell 不把 quickReply 再塞入另一套 props/reducer。
